    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following are techniques of trace element analysis?\n\nOptions: \nA. gas chromatography-mass spectrometry and atomic force microscopy\nB. infrared spectroscopy and ultraviolet-visible spectroscopy\nC. Raman spectroscopy and Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy\nD. electron microscopy and nuclear magnetic resonance\nE. gravitational wave detection and atomic absorption spectroscopy\nF. gamma ray spectroscopy and positron emission tomography\nG. neutron activation analysis and X- ray fluorescence\nH. carbon isotope analysis and experimental replication\nI. accelerator mass spectrometry and photosynthesis pathways\nJ. proton magnetometer and electrical resistivity\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
