    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Younger Dryas was:\n\nOptions: \nA. a period of environmental change that caused humans to temporarily abandon much of northern Europe.\nB. a warming period at the end of the Pleistocene.\nC. a period of glacial expansion between 12,900 and 11,600 years ago.\nD. a period of heavy meteorite impact causing a mass extinction event.\nE. a period of significant volcanic activity that led to a global cooling.\nF. a period of glacial retreat between 10,900 and 9,000 years ago.\nG. a cooling period that occurred during the Jurassic period.\nH. a period of rapid desertification in northern Africa.\nI. a period of glacial retreat that marked the beginning of the Holocene epoch.\nJ. a period of glacial expansion during the Miocene epoch.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
