      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is based on Gorbachev's explicit statement that perestroika was an \"urgent necessity\" to avoid \"serious social, economic, and political crises.\" While other options touch on potential outcomes, option H directly reflects his argument that restructuring was required to prevent an imminent internal breakdown.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
