      "generated_answer": "The markings on the mud-bricks of Huaca del Sol are widely interpreted by archaeologists as \"maker's marks\" used to track the labor contributions of different communities. These symbols helped identify which specific kinship groups or communities (ayllus) produced and delivered the bricks as part of a labor tax system.\n\nThe correct letter choice is: \\boxed{C}",
