    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The first verse from the Qur'an uses authoritative language (\"Leave it aside\") to categorize specific behaviors as \"infamy of Satan's handiwork,\" establishing a clear moral prohibition. This reflects a strict, prescriptive approach to religious behavior intended to ensure spiritual success through discipline. Therefore, it is best described as a puritanical injunction to follow a specific code of conduct.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
