    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **H**.\n\nThe entry of the United States into World War II catalyzed a massive industrial mobilization that ended the Great Depression. Because the U.S. mainland remained largely untouched by the destruction that ravaged the industrial bases of Europe and Asia, the United States emerged from the war as the world's dominant economic and industrial superpower.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
